---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="San Francisco Personal Injury Attorney | Sulfab Law Office"
  description="Injured in an accident? Sulfab Law Office fights for compensation in personal injury cases throughout San Francisco. Call (415) 360-5266."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <img src="/assets/images/personal-injury-hero.png" alt="" class="hero-bg-img" loading="eager" />
      <div class="hero-bg-overlay"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-gold-bar"></div>
        <span class="hero-page-label">Practice Area</span>
        <h1 class="hero-page-title">Your Personal Injury Lawyer in San Francisco</h1>
        <p class="hero-page-subtitle">Life is unpredictable and accidents can happen when we least expect them. Whether it is due to a car accident, a slip and fall, or an injury caused by someone's negligence, the experience can be physically painful and mentally stressful to the person and their family.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="btn-primary">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline">Free Case Evaluation</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-intro-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-intro-content">
        <p>Due to an accident, one person may see that there is an increase in medical costs, wage loss, and insurance adjusters rarely make the process easy. During this difficult and challenging time, having the right legal support can make a meaningful difference.</p>
        <p>At <a href="https://maps.google.com/?cid=17320769596054478689" class="text-gold font-semibold hover:underline">The Sulfab Law Office</a>, we provide assistance to people in San Francisco and the surrounding Bay Area who have been injured in accidents. We provide personal attention, clear guidance and legal support throughout the claims process. As a personal injury lawyer in San Francisco, we ensure that your future is secured while you recover.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="strategic-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="strategic-grid">
        <div class="strategic-sidebar">
          <p class="kicker">Legal Support</p>
          <h2 class="section-heading">Legal Support for Injury Victims</h2>
          <div class="gold-bar"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="strategic-content">
          <p>Each individual accident case is different; that is why our clients get personalized assistance, and we try to learn about their situation. Once we know about it, we offer consultations relevant to the specific case and situation of the client.</p>
          <p>Being an experienced personal injury lawyer in San Francisco, we work on negotiating with the insurance company for your case and trying to settle it. If the insurance company does not provide reasonable compensation, we can represent you in court.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-grid-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="services-grid-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Types of Cases</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">Types of Cases We Handle</h2>
        <p class="services-subtitle">We assist our clients in various types of personal injury claims, including:</p>
        <div class="services-detail-grid">
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3><a href="/car-accidents-lawyer-san-francisco" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Car Accidents</a></h3>
            <p>We represent clients injured in car accidents, working to establish liability and pursue compensation for injuries, medical expenses, vehicle damage, and lost income.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3><a href="/truck-accidents-lawyer-san-francisco" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Truck Accidents</a></h3>
            <p>Commercial truck accidents often involve severe injuries and multiple responsible parties. We conduct thorough investigations to determine liability.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3><a href="/motorcycle-accidents-lawyer-san-francisco" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Motorcycle Accidents</a></h3>
            <p>Motorcyclists are especially vulnerable to catastrophic injuries. We work to protect injured riders from unfair assumptions and insurance company tactics.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3>Bicycle and <a href="/pedestrian-injuries-lawyer-san-francisco" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Pedestrian Injuries</a></h3>
            <p>We represent injured cyclists and pedestrians seeking justice after preventable collisions caused by distracted driving or failure to yield.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3><a href="/slip-and-fall-lawyer-san-francisco" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Slip and Fall Accidents</a></h3>
            <p>Property owners have a legal duty to maintain reasonably safe premises. We help victims pursue premises liability claims against negligent property owners.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3>Dog Bite Injuries</h3>
            <p>Dog attacks can result in significant physical injuries, emotional trauma, and permanent scarring. California law provides important protections for dog bite victims.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3>Construction Accidents</h3>
            <p>Construction sites contain numerous hazards that may lead to serious injuries. We work to protect your legal rights after a construction-related accident.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3><a href="/wrongful-death-lawyer-san-francisco" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Wrongful Death Claims</a></h3>
            <p>Losing a loved one because of another person's negligence is devastating. We assist surviving family members in pursuing wrongful death claims.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="services-subtitle" style="margin-top: 2rem;">For your accident case, we take time to understand your scenario, the whole case and investigate to identify who may be responsible for it. Our primary aim is to assist clients in knowing their legal options and pursuing the compensation they may be entitled to.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cards-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cards-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Legal Framework</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">Understanding California Personal Injury Law</h2>
        <p class="cards-subtitle">Most injury cases are based upon the concept of negligence, where you have to show that another individual was supposed to take care of you, and by breaching the obligation, he or she has caused you harm.</p>
        <div class="cards-grid">
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>Negligence</h3>
            <p>Most injury cases are based on the concept of negligence. You must show that another party owed you a duty of care, breached that obligation, and caused you harm as a result.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>Comparative Negligence</h3>
            <p>In California, you are also covered under the law of comparative negligence, which allows you to collect your losses even if you were partly at fault for the accident. This is why you need the assistance of a personal injury lawyer in San Francisco from the very beginning.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="compensation-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="compensation-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Financial Recovery</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">Compensation You May Be Entitled To</h2>
        <p class="compensation-subtitle">The damages to be recovered in your case may include:</p>
        <div class="compensation-grid">
          <div class="compensation-item">
            <span class="compensation-icon">
              <svg class="lucide" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Medical Costs</h3>
            <p>This includes payment for hospital bills, treatment, medication, rehabilitation, and future costs for your treatment after an injury.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="compensation-item">
            <span class="compensation-icon">
              <svg class="lucide" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Loss of Wages</h3>
            <p>Payment for the income you lose due to your injury, including the wages you are unable to earn while recovering.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="compensation-item">
            <span class="compensation-icon">
              <svg class="lucide" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Reduced Earning Capacity</h3>
            <p>Payment when you are unable to work or earn the same income due to injuries sustained in the accident.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="compensation-item">
            <span class="compensation-icon">
              <svg class="lucide" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Pain and Suffering</h3>
            <p>Compensation for the physical pain, emotional stress and thus poor quality of life that result from the injury.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="compensation-item">
            <span class="compensation-icon">
              <svg class="lucide" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Property Damage</h3>
            <p>Payment for the repairs or replacement of your property after an accident.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="compensation-item">
            <span class="compensation-icon">
              <svg class="lucide" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Wrongful Death Compensation</h3>
            <p>Financial compensation made to eligible family members when a death is a result of someone else's negligence.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="why-us-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="why-us-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Time Matters</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">Why Timing Matters</h2>
        <div class="why-us-subtitle-content">
          <p>It is not easy to find and preserve evidence right after an incident occurs. This is because all the surveillance cameras' records are wiped out, all the scenes are modified, and witnesses' memories tend to fade.</p>
          <p>Furthermore, there are also strict filing deadlines in California law. Seeking legal guidance early allows your attorney to preserve evidence and build the strongest possible case before valuable information is lost.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="why-us-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="why-us-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Why Choose Us</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">Why Choose Our Personal Injury Law Firm San Francisco</h2>
        <p class="why-us-subtitle">Reasons to choose The Sulfab Law Office for personal injury cases are:</p>
        <div class="why-us-grid">
          <div class="why-us-item">
            <h3>Personal Attention</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="why-us-item">
            <h3>Thorough Case Preparation</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="why-us-item">
            <h3>Personalized Legal Representation</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="why-us-item">
            <h3>Assistance For Negotiation With Insurance Companies</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="why-us-item">
            <h3>Experienced Legal Guidance</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="why-us-item">
            <h3>Clear Communication</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="why-us-item">
            <h3>Protect Your Rights Throughout The Legal Process</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="faq-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="faq-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Questions & Answers</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

        <div class="faq-list">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
              <span>How long do I have to file an injury claim in San Francisco?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Generally, in most California personal injury claims, you will have two years after the incident to bring your lawsuit. Cases against a government entity will have shorter deadlines, and hence it is advisable to consult a lawyer as soon as possible.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
              <span>What happens if I was partially at fault for my accident?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Even if you were partly to blame, you can still recover money under California's comparative fault laws. Your final settlement simply gets reduced by your percentage of responsibility.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
              <span>How much does it cost to hire a personal injury lawyer?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Most personal injury lawyers work on a contingency fee, meaning you pay nothing out of pocket upfront. Instead, they take a set percentage directly from whatever settlement or court compensation you win. If you do not recover any money, you don't owe them a fee, though it is always recommended to clarify beforehand how administrative costs (like court filing fees or expert witnesses) will be handled.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-card">
        <div class="cta-glow"></div>
        <div class="cta-content">
          <div class="cta-text">
            <h2>Speak With a San Francisco Personal Injury Lawyer Today!</h2>
            <p>If you or a loved one has been injured due to someone else's negligence, contact <strong>The Sulfab Law Office</strong> at number <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="text-gold hover:underline">(415) 360-5266</a> to schedule a consultation with a professional personal injury lawyer.</p>
            <p>During this difficult time, having the right legal support can make a meaningful difference. We are committed to helping injury victims throughout San Francisco secure their future while they recover.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cta-actions">
            <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="btn-cta">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
            <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline">Schedule a Consultation</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .hero { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .hero-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; }
    .hero-bg-img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center; }
    .hero-bg-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(15,23,42,0.92) 0%, rgba(15,23,42,0.75) 50%, rgba(15,23,42,0.4) 100%); }
    .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

    .services-detail-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
    @media (min-width: 768px) { .services-detail-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
    .service-detail-item { padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #f1f5f9; border-radius: 0.75rem; background-color: rgba(248,250,252,0.5); }
    .service-detail-item h3 { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
    .service-detail-item p { color: #475569; font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }

    .why-us-subtitle-content { max-width: 48rem; margin: 0 auto; }
    .why-us-subtitle-content p { color: #475569; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
    .why-us-subtitle-content p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .faq-section { padding: 4rem 0; background-color: #fff; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
    @media (min-width: 768px) { .faq-section { padding: 5rem 0; } }
    .faq-content { max-width: 48rem; margin: 0 auto; }
    .faq-list { margin-top: 3rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
    .faq-item { border: 1px solid #f1f5f9; border-radius: 1rem; overflow: hidden; background-color: rgba(248,250,252,0.5); }
    .faq-question {
      width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;
      text-align: left; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a;
      transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .faq-question:hover { background-color: rgba(255,251,235,0.3); }
    .faq-icon { width: 1.25rem; height: 1.25rem; color: #B45309; flex-shrink: 0; transition: transform 0.3s ease; }
    .faq-answer { padding: 0 1.5rem; max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.3s ease, padding 0.3s ease; }
    .faq-item.open .faq-icon { transform: rotate(180deg); }
    .faq-item.open .faq-answer { max-height: 500px; padding: 0 1.5rem 1.5rem; }
    .faq-answer p { color: #475569; font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
